#: novel-game-plugin.php
msgid "Return to Title"
msgstr "タイトルに戻る"

msgid "Detective"
msgstr "探偵"

msgid "Misaki"
msgstr "美咲"

msgid "Sato"
msgstr "佐藤"

msgid "Informant"
msgstr "情報屋"

msgid "Ryu-gumi Executive"
msgstr "龍組幹部"

msgid "President Takagi"
msgstr "高木社長"

msgid "Makoto Kurosaki"
msgstr "黒崎誠"

msgid "Pocket Watch"
msgstr "懐中時計"

msgid "Sato's Photo"
msgstr "佐藤の写真"

msgid "Kurosaki's Memo"
msgstr "黒崎の手記"

msgid "Safe Key"
msgstr "金庫の鍵"

msgid "Hidden Ledger"
msgstr "裏帳簿"

msgid "Misaki's Testimony"
msgstr "美咲の証言"

msgid "Misaki's Confession"
msgstr "美咲の告白"

msgid "Sato's Testimony"
msgstr "佐藤の証言"

msgid "Sato's Debt"
msgstr "佐藤の借金"

msgid "Sato's Confession"
msgstr "佐藤の告白"

msgid "Hidden Room"
msgstr "隠し部屋"

msgid "Informant's Intel"
msgstr "情報屋の情報"

msgid "Executive's Slip"
msgstr "幹部の失言"

msgid "Met Takagi"
msgstr "高木との面会"

msgid "Deduction: The Mastermind"
msgstr "推理・黒幕"

msgid "Deduction: Still Alive"
msgstr "推理・生存"

msgid "Deduction: The Villa"
msgstr "推理・別荘"

msgid "Cornered the Mastermind"
msgstr "黒幕への追及"

msgid "Shadow Detective"
msgstr "影の探偵"

msgid ""
"You are the detective. Businessman Makoto Kurosaki vanished from the harbor "
"three nights ago. Question the people around him, gather evidence, expose "
"the contradictions — and when the pieces align, name the mastermind, the "
"truth, and the place. Wrong deductions have consequences."
msgstr ""
"あなたが探偵だ。実業家・黒崎誠は三日前の夜、港から姿を消した。関係者を尋問"
"し、証拠を集め、矛盾を暴け。そして断片が揃ったとき――黒幕を、真相を、監禁場所"
"を推理せよ。誤った推理には、代償が伴う。"

msgid "The trail has gone cold"
msgstr "手掛かりは途絶えた"

msgid "Shadow Detective — The Client"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 依頼人"

msgid ""
"Cold rain had been falling since noon. Just past seven, a woman appeared at "
"my office door, holding a photograph like a prayer."
msgstr ""
"昼から冷たい雨が降り続いていた。七時を回った頃、一枚の写真を祈るように抱えた"
"女が、事務所の扉の前に立っていた。"

msgid "Please, detective. My husband, Makoto, has been missing for three days."
msgstr "お願いします、探偵さん。夫の誠が……三日前から行方不明なんです。"

msgid ""
"The police say he simply ran off. But that evening he called me — he said he "
"would be home by ten."
msgstr ""
"警察は「ただの失踪」だと言うんです。でもあの晩、夫は電話をくれました。「十時"
"までには帰る」と……。"

msgid ""
"A man who calls home before a meeting doesn't vanish by choice. I'll take "
"the case, Mrs. Kurosaki."
msgstr ""
"「帰る」と告げてから消える人間の失踪に、本人の意思などあり得ない。黒崎さん、"
"この依頼、お引き受けします。"

msgid "Ask her to walk through that last evening"
msgstr "最後の晩のことを詳しく聞く"

msgid "Shadow Detective — The Last Evening"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 最後の夜"

msgid ""
"He left at eight, saying a meeting had come up. He took only his coat and "
"his briefcase."
msgstr ""
"あの日は八時に「急な商談が入った」と出て行きました。持って出たのはコートと鞄"
"だけです。"

msgid ""
"A taxi driver remembered him. He was dropped near the harbor warehouses at "
"nine."
msgstr ""
"タクシーの運転手が夫を覚えていました。九時頃、港の倉庫街の近くで降ろしたそう"
"です。"

msgid ""
"And for weeks now, the phone rings late at night. When I answer... no one "
"speaks."
msgstr ""
"それに、ここ数週間……夜中に電話が鳴るんです。出ても、誰も、何も話さない……。"

msgid ""
"A meeting no one knew of, the warehouse district, and silent calls. Three "
"threads. Time to start pulling."
msgstr ""
"誰も知らない商談、倉庫街、そして無言電話。糸は三本。順に手繰るとしよう。"

msgid "Walk the warehouse district where he was last seen"
msgstr "最後に目撃された倉庫街を歩く"

msgid "Visit the residence and hear more from Misaki"
msgstr "黒崎邸で美咲から話を聞く"

msgid "Meet Sato, his oldest friend"
msgstr "旧友の佐藤に会う"

msgid "Shadow Detective — Traces on the Wharf"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 埠頭の痕跡"

msgid ""
"The harbor at dusk. Rusted cranes, walls of containers — and not a single "
"security camera in sight."
msgstr ""
"日暮れの埠頭。錆びたクレーンとコンテナの壁。そして、防犯カメラはただの一台も"
"見当たらない。"

msgid ""
"Fresh tire marks by the loading bay. A heavy car stopped here, then swung "
"around in a hurry."
msgstr ""
"搬入口に真新しいタイヤ痕。大型の車がここで停まり、慌ただしく切り返している。"

msgid ""
"Something glints between the pallets — a pocket watch. The lid is engraved: "
"\"To Makoto. Misaki.\""
msgstr ""
"パレットの隙間で何かが光った。懐中時計だ。蓋には刻印がある――「誠へ 美咲」。"

msgid ""
"The hands stopped at 9:47. A man doesn't drop his wife's gift and stroll "
"away. He left it here — for someone to find."
msgstr ""
"針は九時四十七分で止まっている。妻の贈り物を落として気づかない男はいない。こ"
"れは残していったんだ――誰かが見つけるように。"

msgid "Return to the office and lay out the facts"
msgstr "事務所に戻って事実を並べる"

msgid "Call on Misaki at the residence"
msgstr "黒崎邸の美咲を訪ねる"

msgid "Meet Sato at the cafe"
msgstr "カフェで佐藤に会う"

msgid "Shadow Detective — The Case Board"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 事件簿"

msgid ""
"Back at the office, I pin everything to the corkboard and let the pieces "
"stare back at me."
msgstr ""
"事務所に戻り、手掛かりをすべてコルクボードに留める。あとは、断片たちがこちら"
"を睨み返してくるのを待つだけだ。"

msgid ""
"A vanished businessman. Midnight calls with no voice. A meeting that never "
"existed."
msgstr "消えた実業家。声のない真夜中の電話。存在しなかった商談。"

msgid ""
"Money is the thread. Frightened men run from debts; careful men hide the "
"proof."
msgstr "糸口は金だ。怯えた男は借金から逃げ、慎重な男は証拠を隠す。"

msgid "The board is still full of holes. Time to knock on the next door."
msgstr "ボードはまだ穴だらけだ。次の扉を叩きに行こう。"

msgid ""
"The watch stopped at 9:47 on the wharf. If he dropped it on purpose, he was "
"alive when he left — and he did not leave alone."
msgstr ""
"時計は埠頭で九時四十七分を指して止まっていた。わざと落としたのなら、あの時点"
"で彼は生きていた――そして、独りで立ち去ったのではない。"

msgid ""
"\"The September transfer is the last one. I'm out.\" Men who quit a dirty "
"game rarely keep their freedom — or their lives."
msgstr ""
"「九月の送金で最後だ。俺は降りる」。汚れた盤面から降りようとした人間が、自由"
"のまま――まして無事でいられることは、滅多にない。"

msgid ""
"The ledger bears his initials on every page. The board is nearly complete — "
"now one wrong thread could unravel the whole case."
msgstr ""
"裏帳簿のすべてのページに、あの男のイニシャルがある。盤面はほぼ埋まった――ここ"
"から先は、一本でも糸を引き違えれば事件そのものが解けて消える。"

msgid "Hear Misaki's account at the residence"
msgstr "黒崎邸で美咲の話を聞く"

msgid "Meet Sato, the old friend"
msgstr "旧友の佐藤に会う"

msgid "Ask Misaki about the pocket watch"
msgstr "懐中時計のことを美咲に尋ねる"

msgid "Search Makoto's study"
msgstr "誠の書斎を調べる"

msgid "Go back down to the hidden room"
msgstr "隠し部屋にもう一度降りる"

msgid "Ask Misaki about the safe key"
msgstr "金庫の鍵について美咲に尋ねる"

msgid "Open the safe in the hidden room"
msgstr "隠し部屋の金庫を開ける"

msgid "Take Sato's photo to an informant"
msgstr "佐藤の写真を情報屋に持ち込む"

msgid "Walk into the Ryu-gumi's bar"
msgstr "龍組のバーに乗り込む"

msgid "Press Sato about his debt"
msgstr "借金の件で佐藤を問い詰める"

msgid "Pay a visit to Takagi Construction"
msgstr "高木建設を訪ねる"

msgid "Assemble the deduction"
msgstr "推理を組み立てる"

msgid "Shadow Detective — The House on the Hill"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 丘の上の屋敷"

msgid ""
"He was proud of the company he built from nothing. But this past year, "
"something was eating him alive."
msgstr ""
"夫は、裸一貫で興した会社を誇りにしていました。でもこの一年は……何かが夫を蝕ん"
"でいるようでした。"

msgid ""
"He would shut himself in the study until dawn. Once, I heard him on the "
"phone. He sounded like he was pleading."
msgstr ""
"明け方まで書斎にこもるようになって。一度だけ、電話の声を聞いてしまったんで"
"す。あの人が……懇願するような声でした。"

msgid ""
"Twice, a man came to the door. Broad shoulders, a scar on his jaw. My "
"husband sent me upstairs both times."
msgstr ""
"玄関に男が来たことも二度ありました。肩幅の広い、顎に傷のある男です。夫は二度"
"とも、私を二階へ行かせました。"

msgid ""
"A visitor the wife was never allowed to see. That's not business. That's a "
"collector."
msgstr "妻に決して会わせない客。そいつは商売相手じゃない――取り立て屋だ。"

msgid "Show her the pocket watch"
msgstr "懐中時計を見せる"

msgid "Ask to see the study"
msgstr "書斎を見せてもらう"

msgid "Return to the office"
msgstr "事務所に戻る"

msgid "Shadow Detective — What Misaki Hid"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 美咲の告白"

msgid ""
"This was found where your husband was last seen. I need the whole truth now, "
"Mrs. Kurosaki."
msgstr ""
"これは、ご主人が最後に目撃された場所に落ちていました。黒崎さん、そろそろすべ"
"てを話していただきましょう。"

msgid "...It's the watch I gave him. He never took it off. Not even to sleep."
msgstr ""
"……私が贈った時計です。あの人、片時も外さなかったのに。眠るときでさえ……。"

msgid ""
"Forgive me — I did hear that call. He said: \"The September payment is the "
"last one. After that, I'm out.\""
msgstr ""
"ごめんなさい……本当は、あの電話を聞いてしまったんです。夫は言っていました。"
"「九月の支払いで最後にする。それで俺は降りる」と。"

msgid ""
"I was afraid, detective. I thought if I repeated those words, they would "
"come true."
msgstr ""
"怖かったんです、探偵さん。あの言葉を口にしたら、本当のことになってしまう気が"
"して……。"

msgid "Shadow Detective — An Old Friend"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 旧友"

msgid ""
"Makoto? We've known each other thirty years. If he were in real trouble, I'd "
"know— I mean, I'd want to know."
msgstr ""
"誠か? あいつとは三十年来の付き合いだよ。本当に困ってたなら俺には分かる――い"
"や、その、分かりたかったさ。"

msgid ""
"Actually, last week I saw him near the harbor with some rough-looking men. I "
"took a photo. Just in case."
msgstr ""
"実は先週、港の近くで見かけたんだ。ガラの悪い連中と一緒だった。……念のため、写"
"真を撮っておいた。"

msgid "Near the harbor. And you just happened to be there, camera ready?"
msgstr ""
"港の近く、ね。あんたは偶然そこに居合わせて、偶然カメラを構えていた、と?"

msgid ""
"I— I was passing by, that's all! Here, take the photo. Just find him. Please."
msgstr ""
"と、通りかかっただけだ! ほら、写真は渡す。あいつを……あいつを見つけてくれ。頼"
"む。"

msgid "Have an informant identify the men in the photo"
msgstr "写真の男たちを情報屋に照会する"

msgid "Visit the Kurosaki residence"
msgstr "黒崎邸を訪ねる"

msgid "Shadow Detective — The Study"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 書斎"

msgid ""
"Ledgers, contracts, tax files — all immaculate. Too immaculate for a company "
"said to be gasping for cash."
msgstr ""
"帳簿、契約書、納税記録――どれも完璧だ。資金繰りに喘いでいたはずの会社にして"
"は、完璧すぎる。"

msgid ""
"The books balance perfectly, yet the company was starving. Money flowed "
"through these pages, not into them."
msgstr ""
"数字は綺麗に合っている。なのに会社は飢えていた。つまり金はこの帳簿を「通り抜"
"けて」いただけだ。"

msgid ""
"One bookshelf stands a finger's width off the wall. Behind it — a low door "
"with a dial lock, left half-open."
msgstr ""
"本棚が一つ、指一本ぶんだけ壁から浮いている。裏には――ダイヤル錠の低い扉。しか"
"も、半開きだ。"

msgid ""
"Whoever came for the secret left in a hurry, and empty-handed. Let's see "
"what they couldn't find."
msgstr ""
"秘密を漁りに来た何者かは、慌てて、しかも手ぶらで引き上げたらしい。連中が見つ"
"けられなかったものを、拝むとしよう。"

msgid "Step through the hidden door"
msgstr "隠し扉をくぐる"

msgid "Withdraw and rethink at the office"
msgstr "一旦引き上げて事務所で考える"

msgid "Shadow Detective — The Hidden Room"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 隠し部屋"

msgid ""
"A cramped room. A steel safe, a bare desk, and the stale smell of cigarettes "
"and sleepless nights."
msgstr ""
"狭い部屋だ。スチールの金庫、飾り気のない机、そして煙草と不眠の夜が染みついた"
"匂い。"

msgid ""
"On the desk, a memo in Kurosaki's hand: \"Sept. transfer to T. The last one. "
"I'm out.\""
msgstr ""
"机の上に、黒崎の筆跡のメモ。「九月、Tへ送金。これで最後。俺は降りる」。"

msgid ""
"T. He was paying someone, and September was meant to end it. Men like \"T\" "
"rarely agree to endings."
msgstr ""
"「T」。誰かに金を流し、九月でそれを終わらせるつもりだった。だが「T」のような"
"人種が、終わりに頷くことは滅多にない。"

msgid ""
"The safe won't give. Somewhere there's a key — and I'd wager the lady of the "
"house knows where."
msgstr ""
"金庫はびくともしない。どこかに鍵があるはずだ――そして在処を知っているのは、十"
"中八九この家の夫人だろう。"

msgid "Shadow Detective — The Second Key"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 二つ目の鍵"

msgid "There's a safe behind his bookshelf. I need whatever opens it."
msgstr "書斎の本棚の裏に金庫がありました。開けられるものが要る。"

msgid ""
"A safe? I never knew... wait. His father's desk has a drawer with a false "
"bottom. He kept a small key there."
msgstr ""
"金庫……? 知りませんでした……いえ、待ってください。義父の机の引き出しに二重底が"
"あるんです。あの人、そこに小さな鍵を。"

msgid ""
"Beneath the false bottom lies a small brass key, its surface polished by "
"worried fingers."
msgstr ""
"二重底の下には小さな真鍮の鍵。その表面は、不安げな指に撫でられ続けて艶を帯び"
"ていた。"

msgid ""
"She is still holding something back. I can see it in the way she watches the "
"door."
msgstr ""
"夫人はまだ何かを隠している。扉を気にするあの目つきが、それを語っている。"

msgid ""
"This should fit the dial door. Time to hear what the safe has been keeping "
"quiet."
msgstr ""
"これならあのダイヤル錠に合うはずだ。金庫が黙り込んできた話を、聞かせてもらお"
"う。"

msgid "Open the safe"
msgstr "金庫を開ける"

msgid "Shadow Detective — The Hidden Ledger"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 裏帳簿"

msgid "The key turns with a click that echoes like a gunshot in the tiny room."
msgstr "鍵が回る。小さな部屋に、銃声のようなクリック音が響いた。"

msgid ""
"Inside: bundles of cash, and a second ledger — money moving every month from "
"a city contractor through Kurosaki's firm."
msgstr ""
"中には札束と、もう一冊の帳簿。市の建設業者から黒崎の会社を経由して、毎月金が"
"動いている。"

msgid ""
"Public money, washed clean and returned as \"consulting fees\". And every "
"page is initialed by the same hand: \"T.T.\""
msgstr ""
"公共の金が洗浄され、「コンサルタント料」として還流している。そして全ページに"
"同じ手のイニシャル――「T.T.」。"

msgid ""
"Takagi Construction. The biggest name in the harbor redevelopment. A "
"dangerous name to put in a ledger."
msgstr ""
"高木建設。港湾再開発で一番大きな名前だ。そして、帳簿に書き込むにはあまりに危"
"険な名前でもある。"

msgid ""
"\"The September payment is the last one.\" The entries stop in September — "
"exactly as Misaki heard him promise. And every page bears the same initials: "
"\"T.T.\""
msgstr ""
"「九月の支払いで最後にする」。記帳は九月で途絶えている――美咲が聞いた、あの約"
"束の通りに。そして全ページに、同じイニシャルが並ぶ。「T.T.」。"

msgid "Have the photo identified first"
msgstr "先に写真の男たちを照会する"

msgid "Shadow Detective — The Informant"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 情報屋"

msgid "Two minutes of your time. Who are the men in this photo?"
msgstr "二分だけ時間をくれ。この写真の男たち、何者だ?"

msgid ""
"Heh. The tall one is Gonda — the Ryu-gumi's collections man. Loans, threats, "
"disposal. Full service."
msgstr ""
"へっ。ノッポの方は権田。龍組の取り立て屋だ。融資、脅し、後始末――何でも屋だ"
"よ。"

msgid ""
"And one more thing, since you pay well. Your client's friend — Sato, the "
"cafe gentleman — owes the Ryu-gumi three million."
msgstr ""
"気前のいい旦那にはオマケをつけよう。あんたの依頼人の友達……カフェの佐藤さん"
"よ。ありゃ龍組に三百万の借りがある。"

msgid ""
"Sato owes the same people who took Makoto. And it was Sato's photo that led "
"me here. How very convenient."
msgstr ""
"佐藤の借金相手は、誠を攫った連中と同じ。そして俺をここまで導いたのは、その佐"
"藤の写真ときた。……ずいぶん出来た偶然だ。"

msgid "Shadow Detective — The Dragon's Den"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 龍の巣"

msgid "A detective, in my bar. You've got nerve — or nothing left to lose."
msgstr ""
"探偵さんがうちの店とはね。いい度胸だ――それとも、失うものがもう無いのか?"

msgid ""
"Makoto Kurosaki. Your man Gonda met him on the wharf the night he vanished. "
"I can put them both there at 9:47."
msgstr ""
"黒崎誠。あんたのところの権田が、失踪の夜に埠頭で会っている。九時四十七分、二"
"人がそこにいたことを俺は示せる。"

msgid ""
"Careful now. We lent Kurosaki money, that's all. Think, detective — a dead "
"man repays nothing. Thirty million says we keep him breathing."
msgstr ""
"口の利き方に気をつけな。うちは黒崎に金を貸した、それだけだ。よく考えろ探偵さ"
"ん――死人は一円も返さねえ。三千万って額が、あいつの息の根を保証してんのさ。"

msgid ""
"\"We keep him breathing.\" Not \"we don't have him.\" The dragon just showed "
"me one of his cards."
msgstr ""
"「息の根を保証している」――「うちにはいない」ではなく、だ。龍は今、手札を一枚"
"見せた。"

msgid "Force your way into the back rooms"
msgstr "力ずくで奥へ踏み込む"

msgid "Shadow Detective — A Friend's Confession"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 友の告白"

msgid ""
"Three million to the Ryu-gumi, Sato. And a perfect photo of Makoto, taken "
"the week he disappears. Start talking."
msgstr ""
"龍組に三百万の借金。そして誠が消えた週に撮られた、出来すぎた写真。佐藤さん、"
"そろそろ話してもらおうか。"

msgid ""
"...They said they only wanted his schedule! A debt wiped clean, for a few "
"dates and places. I never thought they would—"
msgstr ""
"……連中は「予定が知りたいだけだ」と言ったんだ! 日付と場所をいくつか教えれば借"
"金は帳消しだと。まさか、あんなことになるなんて――"

msgid ""
"The night it happened, Gonda's car passed me by the harbor gate. It didn't "
"turn toward their office. It took the coast road — toward President Takagi's "
"villa."
msgstr ""
"あの晩、港の門の前で権田の車とすれ違った。車は組の事務所へは曲がらなかった。"
"海岸道路を――高木社長の別荘の方へ走っていったんだ。"

msgid ""
"The coast road. Sato — that guilt of yours may have just saved your friend's "
"life."
msgstr ""
"海岸道路か。佐藤さん……あんたのその罪悪感が、親友の命綱になったかもしれんぞ。"

msgid "Return to the office and build the case"
msgstr "事務所に戻って推理を固める"

msgid "Shadow Detective — The Man Behind the Harbor"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 港を牛耳る男"

msgid ""
"A private detective. How quaint. I gave Kurosaki-kun his first contract, you "
"know. Terrible business, his disappearance."
msgstr ""
"私立探偵とは、また古風な。黒崎くんに最初の仕事をやったのは私でね。失踪とは……"
"実に痛ましい話だ。"

msgid ""
"His firm moved your money for years. Consulting fees. Harbor redevelopment. "
"The paperwork is remarkably tidy."
msgstr ""
"彼の会社は長年あんたの金を動かしてきた。コンサルタント料、港湾再開発。書類は"
"見事なまでに整っていたよ。"

msgid ""
"Rumors. Show me one document with my name on it, and I will show you my "
"lawyers."
msgstr ""
"噂話だな。私の名前が載った書類を一枚でも見せてみたまえ。こちらは弁護士を見せ"
"てやろう。"

msgid ""
"He didn't ask which money. From a careful man, a careless word is worth more "
"than a confession."
msgstr ""
"「どの金の話だ」とは訊き返さなかったな。用心深い男の不用意な一言は、自白より"
"雄弁だ。"

msgid ""
"He wants a document with his name. I have a ledger with his initials on "
"every page — but not here. Not until the whole picture is airtight."
msgstr ""
"名前入りの書類が見たいそうだが、こちらには全ページに奴のイニシャルが並ぶ帳簿"
"がある。――だが、まだ出さない。絵の全体が固まるまでは。"

msgid "Assemble the deduction at the office"
msgstr "事務所で推理を組み立てる"

msgid "Dig for more before the confrontation"
msgstr "対決の前にもう少し材料を集める"

msgid "Shadow Detective — Deduction I: The Hand That Moves"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 推理Ⅰ・盤面を動かす手"

msgid ""
"Night. The desk lamp draws a small circle of light around everything I know."
msgstr ""
"夜。デスクランプの明かりが、俺の知るすべてを小さな光の輪の中に集めている。"

msgid ""
"The ledger, the memo, the debts, the lies. Behind them all — whose hand has "
"been moving the pieces?"
msgstr ""
"帳簿、手記、借金、そして嘘。このすべての裏で――駒を動かしてきたのは、誰の手だ?"

msgid ""
"Name the wrong player, and the real one sweeps the board while I kick down "
"the wrong door. Think."
msgstr ""
"指す名を間違えれば、俺が違う扉を蹴破っている間に、本物が盤面を拭い去る。考え"
"ろ。"

msgid "President Takagi. The initials, the money, the motive."
msgstr "黒幕は高木社長だ。イニシャル、金の流れ、そして動機。"

msgid "The Ryu-gumi. Collectors turned kidnappers."
msgstr "龍組だ。取り立て屋が拉致に走った。"

msgid "Sato. The friend who knew his every move."
msgstr "佐藤だ。誠の動きを知り尽くした友人。"

msgid "Not yet. I will not accuse without proof."
msgstr "まだだ。証拠なしに人を指せない。"

msgid "Shadow Detective — Deduction II: Alive or Dead"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 推理Ⅱ・生か死か"

msgid ""
"Takagi gave the order; the Ryu-gumi carried it out. But carried out — what, "
"exactly?"
msgstr "高木が命じ、龍組が実行した。だが「実行」の中身は、正確には何だった?"

msgid ""
"The watch was dropped, not smashed. No blood on the wharf, no body in the "
"bay, no ransom note on the door."
msgstr ""
"時計は「落とされて」いた。叩き壊されたのではなく。埠頭に血痕はなく、湾に遺体"
"もなく、扉に脅迫状も貼られていない。"

msgid "So answer it straight: is Makoto Kurosaki alive?"
msgstr "なら、正面から答えを出せ。黒崎誠は――生きているのか?"

msgid ""
"\"A dead man repays nothing. Thirty million says we keep him breathing.\" "
"The executive's slip fits the clean wharf: no blood, no body, no note."
msgstr ""
"「死人は一円も返さねえ。三千万があいつの息の根を保証してる」。あの幹部の失言"
"は、血痕ひとつない埠頭と綺麗に噛み合う。"

msgid "Alive. He's worth nothing to them dead."
msgstr "生きている。死なせては連中に一銭の価値もない。"

msgid "Dead. They silenced him that night."
msgstr "死んでいる。あの夜、口を封じられた。"

msgid "He staged everything and fled abroad."
msgstr "すべて自作自演で、海外へ逃げた。"

msgid "I can't call it yet. Back to the streets."
msgstr "まだ断定できない。足で稼ぎ直す。"

msgid "Shadow Detective — Deduction III: The Coast Road"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 推理Ⅲ・海岸道路の果て"

msgid ""
"Alive, hidden, and useful. Where does Takagi cage a man who knows where "
"every yen is buried?"
msgstr ""
"生きていて、隠されていて、まだ利用価値がある。すべての金の在処を知る男を、高"
"木はどこに閉じ込める?"

msgid ""
"Not the Ryu-gumi's bar — too many eyes already on it. Not a hotel — too many "
"witnesses he doesn't own."
msgstr ""
"龍組のバーではない――あそこはもう人目がありすぎる。ホテルでもない――買収しきれ"
"ない目撃者が多すぎる。"

msgid "Say it out loud, and stake the case on it."
msgstr "口に出せ。この事件のすべてを、その一点に賭けろ。"

msgid ""
"Sato watched Gonda's car take the coast road that night. And the coast road "
"ends at exactly one property worth hiding a man in."
msgstr ""
"あの夜、佐藤は権田の車が海岸道路へ向かうのを見ている。そして海岸道路の行き止"
"まりには、人ひとり隠すに足る建物がただ一つしかない。"

msgid "Takagi's villa, at the end of the coast road."
msgstr "海岸道路の果て、高木の別荘だ。"

msgid "The back rooms of the Ryu-gumi's bar."
msgstr "龍組のバーの奥だ。"

msgid "A freighter already out of the harbor."
msgstr "もう港を出た貨物船の中だ。"

msgid "Not sure enough. One more round of legwork."
msgstr "確証が足りない。もう一度足で固める。"

msgid "Shadow Detective — The Villa"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 別荘"

msgid ""
"The villa at the end of the coast road. Beyond the iron gate, a single "
"window burns on the second floor."
msgstr ""
"海岸道路の果ての別荘。鉄の門の向こう、二階の窓に一つだけ明かりが灯っている。"

msgid ""
"Detective. This is private property. One phone call and you are finished in "
"this city."
msgstr "探偵くん。ここは私有地だよ。電話一本で、君はこの街で終わりだ。"

msgid ""
"Make the call. The police will want to see the second floor too — and this "
"ledger, initialed by you on every page."
msgstr ""
"どうぞかけてくれ。警察は二階の部屋にも興味を持つだろうさ――それと、全ページに"
"あんたのイニシャルが入ったこの帳簿にもな。"

msgid ""
"...What do you want? Money? A seat on a board? Name your figure and "
"disappear."
msgstr "……何が望みだ。金か? 役員の椅子か? 望みの数字を言って、消えたまえ。"

msgid ""
"The only figure I want is the man upstairs — alive. And then the truth. All "
"of it, in your own words."
msgstr ""
"欲しい数字はただ一つ、二階の男の生存だ。それから真実を。すべてを、あんた自身"
"の口から。"

msgid "Lay every piece of evidence on the table"
msgstr "すべての証拠を卓上に並べる"

msgid "Demand to see Kurosaki first"
msgstr "まず黒崎の無事を確かめさせろと迫る"

msgid "Shadow Detective — The Whole Truth"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― すべての真実"

msgid ""
"Kurosaki wanted out. Out! With everything he knew about the harbor money "
"still in that stubborn head of his."
msgstr ""
"黒崎は降りると言った。降りる、だと! 港の金の流れを何もかも、あの頑固な頭に詰"
"め込んだままでだ。"

msgid ""
"So Gonda collected him from the wharf that night. No one was to be hurt. He "
"simply had to be persuaded — to stay quiet."
msgstr ""
"だからあの夜、権田が埠頭で奴を回収した。手荒な真似はさせていない。ただ「黙っ"
"ていること」を納得させる必要があった、それだけだ。"

msgid ""
"The midnight calls? Gonda's idea. A telephone that rings and says nothing — "
"so the house never forgets what silence sounds like."
msgstr ""
"真夜中の電話? あれは権田の考えだ。鳴っても何も言わない電話――「沈黙」がどうい"
"う音か、あの家に忘れさせないためのな。"

msgid ""
"Then the ledger vanished from his study. Three days I asked him, politely, "
"where it went. Three days, he said nothing at all."
msgstr ""
"そこへ来て、書斎から帳簿が消えた。三日間、丁重に尋ねたよ、「どこへやった」と"
"ね。三日間、奴は何ひとつ喋らなかった。"

msgid ""
"Upstairs, behind a locked door, a hollow-cheeked man lifts his head at the "
"sound of new footsteps."
msgstr "二階、施錠された扉の奥。頬のこけた男が、聞き慣れない足音に顔を上げた。"

msgid "Open the door"
msgstr "扉を開ける"

msgid "Shadow Detective — The Man Upstairs"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 二階の男"

msgid "You're... not one of Takagi's men. Then who—"
msgstr "あんたは……高木の手の者じゃないな。なら、誰だ――"

msgid "A detective. Your wife hired me. She never once believed you ran."
msgstr ""
"探偵だ。あんたの奥さんに雇われた。彼女は一度だって、あんたが逃げたとは思って"
"いなかった。"

msgid ""
"Misaki... I dropped the watch on the wharf, praying someone would read it "
"right. Three days, I've been holding on to that prayer."
msgstr ""
"美咲……。埠頭で時計を落としたのは、誰かが読み解いてくれると祈ったからだ。この"
"三日、その祈りだけを握りしめていた。"

msgid ""
"The police are on the coast road now. It's over. All that's left is to "
"decide how much of the truth we hand them."
msgstr ""
"警察はもう海岸道路に入っている。終わったんだ。あとは――真実をどこまで警察に渡"
"すか、それを決めるだけだ。"

msgid "Hand over everything — ledger, memo, watch, and every testimony"
msgstr "すべてを引き渡す――帳簿、手記、時計、そして全員の証言を"

msgid "Bring him home first. The rest can wait."
msgstr "まず彼を家に帰す。あとのことは、それからだ。"

msgid "Shadow Detective — Ending: Into the Light"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 結末・光の中へ"

msgid ""
"One week later, the harbor scandal owns every front page. Takagi arrested. "
"The Ryu-gumi raided. The ledger in an evidence vault."
msgstr ""
"一週間後。港のスキャンダルが全紙の一面を飾った。高木は逮捕、龍組は家宅捜索、"
"裏帳簿は証拠保管庫の中だ。"

msgid ""
"Detective. You gave me back my husband — and the truth with him. I don't "
"have words enough."
msgstr ""
"探偵さん。あなたは夫を――そして真実まで、返してくださいました。お礼の言葉が見"
"つかりません。"

msgid ""
"The watch is back where it belongs. And this time, the September payment "
"really was the last."
msgstr ""
"時計はあるべき場所に戻ったよ。そして今度こそ、九月の支払いが本当に最後になっ"
"た。"

msgid ""
"Rain again tonight. Some cases end with a cell door closing. The good ones "
"end with a lit window in a warm house."
msgstr ""
"今夜もまた雨だ。独房の扉が閉まって終わる事件もある。だが上等な事件というやつ"
"は、温かい家の窓明かりで終わるものだ。"

msgid "Complete Solution — Every truth brought into the light"
msgstr "完全解決 ― すべての真実が光の中へ"

msgid "Shadow Detective — Ending: A Half Truth"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 結末・半分の真実"

msgid "Makoto Kurosaki came home. That much of the job, I did."
msgstr "黒崎誠は家に帰った。仕事のそこまでは、確かに果たした。"

msgid ""
"But the chain of proof had gaps, and Takagi's lawyers cut the ledger loose. "
"\"Insufficient corroboration,\" the court called it."
msgstr ""
"だが証拠の鎖には隙間があり、高木の弁護士どもは帳簿を切り離した。法廷いわく――"
"「裏付け不十分」。"

msgid ""
"He sold the villa, paid a fine, and smiled for the cameras. The dragon lost "
"a claw. Nothing more."
msgstr ""
"奴は別荘を売り、罰金を払い、カメラに向かって微笑んでみせた。龍は爪を一本失っ"
"た。ただ、それだけだ。"

msgid ""
"A half truth keeps a man awake worse than any lie. Someday, Takagi. Someday."
msgstr ""
"半分だけの真実は、どんな嘘より寝覚めが悪い。いつか必ずだ、高木。いつか必ず。"

msgid "Partial Solution — The mastermind slips the net"
msgstr "部分解決 ― 黒幕は網の目を逃れた"

msgid "Shadow Detective — Ending: The Wrong Door"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 結末・誤った扉"

msgid ""
"I was so sure. I named the wrong name, kicked the wrong door — and watched "
"the case fall apart in my hands."
msgstr ""
"確信していたはずだった。俺は違う名を挙げ、違う扉を蹴破り――手の中で事件が崩れ"
"ていくのを見た。"

msgid ""
"While the papers laughed at the detective who cried wolf, a quieter hand "
"swept the board clean."
msgstr ""
"「狼少年の探偵」と新聞が笑っている間に、もっと静かな手が盤面を拭い去った。"

msgid ""
"The ledger is ash now. The witnesses have forgotten my face. And Makoto "
"Kurosaki is still out there — somewhere."
msgstr ""
"帳簿は今頃、灰だ。証人たちは俺の顔を忘れた。そして黒崎誠は、今もどこかに囚わ"
"れたままだ。"

msgid ""
"A detective's oath: when you are wrong, you start over — from the very first "
"thread."
msgstr "探偵の流儀はひとつ。間違えたなら、最初の糸から手繰り直せ。"

msgid "False Deduction — The truth slipped through your fingers"
msgstr "誤推理 ― 真実は指の間をすり抜けた"

msgid "Shadow Detective — Ending: Dead End"
msgstr "影の探偵 ― 結末・袋小路"

msgid "Force, against a house built on force. It was over in half a minute."
msgstr "暴力の上に建った家に、暴力で踏み込んだ。勝負は三十秒で終わった。"

msgid ""
"They left me in the back alley with a receipt written in bruises: the next "
"visit ends in the harbor."
msgstr ""
"気がつけば裏路地だ。「次に来たら港に沈む」――そう、痣で書かれた領収書を体中に"
"貼り付けられて。"

msgid ""
"By morning, every door in the case had quietly shut. Witnesses moved away. "
"The client received a generous \"settlement\"."
msgstr ""
"朝までに、事件のすべての扉が静かに閉じた。証人は街を離れ、依頼人のもとには気"
"前のいい「示談金」が届いた。"

msgid ""
"A detective who runs out of patience runs out of everything. This case is a "
"dead end — and the dead end is mine."
msgstr ""
"忍耐を切らした探偵は、すべてを切らす。この事件は袋小路だ――そして袋小路にいる"
"のは、この俺だ。"

msgid "Dead End — The investigation is closed"
msgstr "袋小路 ― 捜査は打ち切られた"

msgid ""
"Makoto's pocket watch, found on the wharf. Stopped at 9:47 — dropped on "
"purpose."
msgstr ""
"埠頭で見つかった誠の懐中時計。九時四十七分で止まっている。故意に落とされたも"
"の。"

msgid ""
"A photo of Makoto with rough-looking men near the harbor, taken by Sato."
msgstr "佐藤が撮った、港の近くでガラの悪い男たちと一緒にいる誠の写真。"

msgid ""
"A memo in Makoto's hand: \"Sept. transfer to T. The last one. I'm out.\""
msgstr "誠の筆跡のメモ。「九月、Tへ送金。これで最後。俺は降りる」。"

msgid ""
"A brass key from the false-bottomed drawer. Opens the safe in the hidden "
"room."
msgstr "二重底の引き出しにあった真鍮の鍵。隠し部屋の金庫を開ける。"

msgid ""
"A second ledger tracking laundered public money. Every page initialed \"T.T."
"\""
msgstr "洗浄された公金の流れを記す裏帳簿。全ページに「T.T.」のイニシャル。"

msgid ""
"Misaki spoke of sleepless nights, a pleading phone call, and a scarred "
"visitor."
msgstr "美咲の証言。眠れない夜、懇願するような電話、顎に傷のある来訪者。"

msgid ""
"Misaki admitted overhearing him: \"The September payment is the last one. "
"I'm out.\""
msgstr ""
"美咲の告白。「九月の支払いで最後にする。俺は降りる」という電話を聞いていた。"

msgid "Sato provided the photo — but his story has holes."
msgstr "佐藤の証言。写真を提供したが、その説明には穴がある。"

msgid "The informant says Sato owes the Ryu-gumi three million."
msgstr "情報屋いわく、佐藤は龍組に三百万の借金がある。"

msgid ""
"Sato sold Makoto's schedule for his debt — and saw Gonda's car take the "
"coast road."
msgstr ""
"佐藤の告白。借金のカタに誠の予定を流し、権田の車が海岸道路へ向かうのを見た。"

msgid ""
"Behind the study bookshelf: a dial-locked door someone else searched in a "
"hurry."
msgstr ""
"書斎の本棚の裏にダイヤル錠の隠し扉。何者かが慌ただしく漁った形跡がある。"

msgid "The tall man in the photo is Gonda, the Ryu-gumi's collections man."
msgstr "写真のノッポの男は、龍組の取り立て屋・権田だと判明した。"

msgid ""
"\"A dead man repays nothing. Thirty million says we keep him breathing.\""
msgstr ""
"幹部の失言。「死人は一円も返さねえ。三千万があいつの息の根を保証してる」。"

msgid ""
"President Takagi never asked which money. A careless word from a careful man."
msgstr ""
"高木社長は「どの金の話か」と訊き返さなかった。用心深い男の、不用意な一言。"

msgid "Concluded that President Takagi is the hand moving the pieces."
msgstr "盤面を動かしてきた手は高木社長だと結論づけた。"

msgid "Concluded that Makoto is alive — worth nothing to them dead."
msgstr "誠は生きていると結論づけた。死なせては連中に価値がない。"

msgid "Concluded that Makoto is held at the villa on the coast road."
msgstr "誠は海岸道路の別荘に囚われていると結論づけた。"

msgid "Confronted Takagi at the villa with the ledger."
msgstr "別荘で帳簿を突きつけ、高木を追い詰めた。"

